 compiling this Slang code:\n```slang\n[shader(\"compute\")]\n[numthreads(8, 8, 1)]\nfunc crash(uint3 threadId: SV_DispatchThreadID) -> float4 {\n    return float4(1.f);\n}\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[spirv-crash-mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22579301/spirv-crash-mrp.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110984/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110984/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}